{"step_index":81,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-17T19:40:36Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Updated walkthrough.md summarizing the multi-tabbed layout reorganization of NexusMobility","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: NexusMobility — Clean Multi-Tabbed Enterprise Layout\n\n**NexusMobility** has been completely reorganized from a single crowded dashboard into a clean, 4-tabbed enterprise layout with smooth view transitions, dynamic interactive controls, and dedicated focus areas.\n\n---\n\n## 🌟 4-Tab Reorganization Summary\n\n1. **Tab 1: \"Eco-Route Finder & Map\"**:\n   - Focus: Navigation, 3D corridor visualization, and dynamic commute planning.\n   - Interactive 3D metropolitan corridor map with drag-to-orbit and zoom controls.\n   - Origin & Destination station selectors with automatic eco-route computation.\n   - **Dynamic Commuter Density Slider (1 to 4 Passengers)**: Allows users to slide between *1 Solo*, *2 Pooled*, *3 Pooled*, and *4 Max Pool*, instantly recalculating the fare split per seat, carbon savings multiplier, and solo cars removed.\n\n2. **Tab 2: \"Commuter Passenger Hub\"**:\n   - Focus: Commuter ride booking and dispatch queue operations.\n   - Dedicated passenger ride request form.\n   - Live passenger dispatch conveyor pipeline with priority indicators (`Next Dispatch`, `Priority #2`).\n   - Priority Standby Lounge (5 Slots) with 3D rotating ring buffer, usage indicator (`0/5` to `5/5`), and overflow limits.\n\n3. **Tab 3: \"Driver Fleet & Dispatch Console\"**:\n   - Focus: Driver partner operations, vehicle capacity, and active trips.\n   - Split grid containing driver onboarding with the **interactive top-down 4-seat vehicle blueprint** (click seats to toggle availability).\n   - Live fleet directory stream showing partner cards and free seat counts.\n   - Active shared trips console with route compatibility badges (e.g. `96% Route Match`).\n   - Flexible identity search bar supporting both numeric Driver IDs (`#101`) and alphanumeric Booking References (`NX-501`, `BK-201`).\n   - \"Revert Last Confirmation\" instant trip undo control.\n\n4. **Tab 4: \"City Sustainability Analytics\"**:\n   - Focus: Environmental and enterprise metrics.\n   - Net CO₂ emissions reduced (kg), single-driver vehicles eliminated, and fleet seat utilization rate (%).\n   - Top Eco-Driver Partner Leaderboard with gamified achievement badges (*\"Carbon Crusader\"*, *\"5-Star Commute\"*, *\"Zero-Emission Pioneer\"*, *\"Master Navigator\"*).\n   - Interactive Eco-Transit Journey Receipt modal viewer and printer.\n\n5. **Smooth UX & Memory-Safe 3D Tilt**:\n   - Tab switching uses smooth `fadeIn` / `translateY` animations.\n   - Leak-free 3D anti-gravity tilt listeners are automatically rebound to visible cards upon tab change.\n   - One-click \"Export Package (.ZIP)\" button in the header bundles the entire platform offline.\n\n---\n\n## 📁 Source Files\n- **Application**: [index.html](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html)\n- **Design System**: [styles.css](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/styles.css)\n- **Engine Logic**: [app.js](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/app.js)\n- **Operating Manual**: [README.md](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/README.md)\n","Description":"Updated walkthrough.md for multi-tabbed layout reorganization","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Kartik Bhosle\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md for multi-tabbed layout"}}]}
