{"step_index":87,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-17T19:54:06Z","content":"I have prepared the implementation plan for the requested visual, interactive, and UX enhancements to **NexusMobility — Smart City Eco-Logistics** in [implementation_plan.md](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/implementation_plan.md).\n\n### Summary of Enhancements:\n1. **Clean Header**: Removed the \"Export Package (.ZIP)\" button; streamlined down to essential primary controls (*\"Rush-Hour Simulation\"* & *\"Book Eco-Ride\"*).\n2. **Smooth 2D Micro-Lifting Hover**: Eliminated the heavy 3D mouse tilt and replaced it with an ultra-smooth 2D elevation (`transform: translateY(-4px)` with soft emerald/slate drop shadow) for comfortable, stutter-free browsing.\n3. **Enhanced Spatial Map with Directional Flow & Animated Car**:\n   - Directional chevron flow pulses indicating travel direction from Origin to Destination along corridor vectors.\n   - A top-down electric car driving along the route path with glowing headlights and light trails upon route calculation or trip dispatch.\n   - Enhanced station nodes with distinct icons and zone tags.\n4. **Ambient Floating Leaf & Energy Canvas**: Subtle, slow-floating green leaves and soft electric energy particles on the background canvas.\n5. **EcoSprout Mascot**: A charming vector illustrated character wearing driving goggles and a leaf cap featured inside empty state containers and alerts.\n6. **Enterprise Alert Modals**: Polished dialogs for Dispatch Confirmations and Trip Reversals featuring full impact breakdowns and action buttons.\n\nPlease review the plan and click **Proceed** or let me know if you would like any modifications!"}
